  "type": {
    "_doc": "Infisical's scale is markedly denser than Terminal's original: 14px body, 12px meta, headings that top out around 20px. `display` substitutes Inter Tight for Alliance No. 2 (commercial, non-redistributable); `mono` is JetBrains Mono, as upstream.",
    "family": {
      "display": "\"Inter Tight\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif",
      "sans": "Inter, system-ui, sans-serif",
      "mono": "\"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, monospace"
    },
    "size": {
      "2xs": "11px",
      "xs": "12px",
      "sm": "13px",
      "base": "14px",
      "lg": "16px",
      "xl": "20px",
      "2xl": "26px",
      "3xl": "32px"
    },
    "weight": {
      "regular": "400",
      "medium": "500",
      "semibold": "600",
      "bold": "700"
    },
    "_role_doc": "Named type roles (ch.03 §2). size/line/weight feed Tailwind fontSize tuples; `family` is a hint applied via font-display|font-sans|font-mono on the element.",
